  "zh": "# 星舰回收、微软故障氯气、Qwen4-Max、DeepSeek 算力、APEC 深圳、伊朗袭美基地、家庭缩小、日本 GDP 负增长\n## AI 与科技\n- **Qwen4-Max 发布**：阿里最新万亿参数模型开源，性能直逼 GPT-4，开发者可直接调用。\n- **DeepSeek 算力不足**：头部大模型训练遭遇算力瓶颈，折射国内算力供给紧张。\n## 前沿科技\n- **SpaceX 星舰回收**：星舰第 15 次飞行实现整箭回收，可重复使用迈出关键步。\n- **微软故障致氯气中毒**：Microsoft 365 宕机导致酒店氯气泄漏 15 人中毒，暴露云服务物理风险。\n## 国际视野\n- **APEC 深圳峰会**：中国时隔 12 年再任东道主，区域经贸合作或迎新突破。\n- **伊朗袭击美军基地**：伊朗称打击美军基地为“回应侵略”，中东紧张局势升级。\n## 社会与经济\n- **家庭户均 2.52 人**：全国平均家庭规模 25 年减少近 1 人，养老与住房压力加大。\n- **日本 GDP 再负增长**：日本 Q3 GDP 环比下滑，经济复苏乏力引发市场担忧。",
  "en": "# Starship recovered, Microsoft outage chlorine, Qwen4-Max released, DeepSeek compute crunch, APEC Shenzhen, Iran strikes US bases, household size 2.52, Japan GDP negative\n## AI & Tech\n- **Qwen4-Max released**: Alibaba's new trillion‑parameter model opensource, performance nears GPT‑4 for developers.\n- **DeepSeek compute crunch**: Leading LLM training hits hardware limits, highlighting China's tight GPU supply.\n## Frontier Tech\n- **Starship recovered**: SpaceX Flight 15 achieves full‑stack recovery, a milestone for reusable rockets.\n- **Microsoft outage chlorine leak**: 365 downtime triggers hotel chlorine release, poisoning 15 guests, exposing cloud‑physical risk.\n## Global Affairs\n- **APEC Shenzhen summit**: China hosts APEC after 12 years, set to boost regional trade cooperation.\n- **Iran strikes US bases**: Iran frames missile hits as “response to aggression,” raising Middle East tensions.\n## Society & Economy\n- **Household size 2.52**: Average Chinese household shrinks to 2.52 persons, down nearly one in 25 years, pressuring pensions and housing.\n- **Japan GDP negative again**: Q3 GDP contracts, signaling fragile recovery and market worry."
